    { "f": 1.610, "n": "Yellowstone Travelers Information — AM", "z": "黄石旅客信息台 · 中波", "c": "broadcast", "m": "AM", "conf": "high", "a": "AM Broadcast", "d": "Low-power AM loops at every park entrance covering road construction, closures and safety warnings. This is genuinely the most practical broadcast in the park and your VX-6 tunes down far enough to receive it. Watch for the roadside signs, which give the exact frequency.", "dz": "每个公园入口都有小功率中波循环播报，内容包括道路施工、封闭和安全警示。这是园内最实用的广播，而 VX-6 的调谐下限足够低，能收到。注意路边指示牌，上面写明具体频率。", "odds": 3 },
